window.products.push({"id":144040,"name":"Beaquicy WB44X200 Bake Element Replacement for GE 240V oven element wb44x200 - Suitable for jkp07g*d2, jkp16g*07, jkp16g*d1, jkp16g*d2, jkp16g*h1, jkp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FvJrVMoSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【bake element wb44x200】--- WB44X200 Oven Heating Element is designed for free standing electric ranges with screw-in terminals. It is at the bottom of the oven and supplies the heat for baking.The rated voltage is 240 Volt and the rated power is 3100 Watt. ▶The measurements: 13-1/4\" wide X 16-5/8\" deep (connectors go a little deeper), height from floor of oven to top of element is 1\" AND TERMINAL ENDS SPACED ~1-1/4\" APART (outside of element to outside of element) The package includes 1 x WB44X200 Oven Bake Element. ✅【Made of Stainless steel alloy】--- WB44X200 Oven Lower Bake Element is made of high quality stainless steel alloy, meet OEM requirements, and has a long service life. If any of the following occurs, replace it in time: ★Broken; ★Not working. ⚠️ To avoid a risk of electrical shock, before replacing it, you must unplug the range or shut off the circuit breaker to the unit. To avoid a risk of burn, make sure that the range is off, and the unit’s heating element is cool to the touch. ✅【Suitable for GE and more brands】--- replacement oven element WB44X200 Oven Heating Element can fit for GE, Hot-point, Ameri-cana and Ken-more Oven. ★Replaces Part Numbers: 3267, AP2031031, PS249424, EAP249424, JKP27GJ3, JKP27GJ4, JKP27J3, JKP27J4, JKP27J5, RJ742G*J4, RJ742G*J5, RJ742G*T6, RJ742G*T7, RJ745G*J1, RJ745G*J2, JRP03J5, JRP03J6, 21233 (1988), 21234(1988), 21235(1988), 21236 (1988), 21331(1988), JKP37G*L1, RJ735*T2, JKP26G*01, RK767*T4, JMP22*02, JMP22*01, RJ742G*T3, RJ742*T4, RK747G*T2, RK747*T5, RJ742*T1, RJ745G*T4, etc. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】--- WB44X200 ge oven element replacement supports 365 DAYS return and exchange.Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【BRING CONVENIENCE FOR YOUR LIFE】--- Before installing WB44X200 Oven Bake Element , unplug your oven or turn off the circuit breaker. Helpful tools include a phillips screwdriver and pair of work gloves.Unscrewed the two screws that held the element in place,needed pliers to remove the sta-kon connectors from old element. Attached them to new element and put screws back in place. You can find related videos on YouTube. The operation is simple, and you can save a lot of repair costs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FvJrVMoSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B087M747FD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-144040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087M747FD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087M747FD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
