window.products.push({"id":144117,"name":"Pour Over Coffee Maker - Stainless Steel Permanent Dripper Serves up to 4 Cups of Robust Coffee and Tea - Reusable Cone-Shaped Filter for Brewed Coffe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719cKOdF6eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Hryser pour over coffee maker is perfect for you if you like coffee and ✅ want a good cup NOW. To make a nice cup of coffee, just place the filter on top of a mug, cup or thermos, and put ground coffee into the filter. Pour hot water around the sides of the filter in a circular motion until your cup is full. Strong, bold flavored coffee is ready in 2-3 minutes. A tip: use freshly roasted beans (within the past week or so), freshly ground (within the past few minutes) and hot water (195-205 degrees Fahrenheit). ✅don’t like squandering money. You won’t buy those paper filters anymore! Moreover, you need less coffee to get a robust drink, so it's coffee-saving as well. ✅are looking for high quality. Paper filters soak up the oils of the coffee, which is where most of the flavor comes from.While using our reusable coffee filter, you will enjoy the full depth and delicious taste of your coffee. Besides this, you won’t have to deal with those “oh, crap” situations when you suddenly discover that you have run out of paper filters! ✅detest messy coffee makers. Just dump the grounds into the trash and rinse the filter with hot water.You can use a soft brush or cloth to wipe the inside, and soapy water to clean the top. If any residue appears, add a small amount of vinegar to the soapy water and then rinse well. After each wash, let it dry. Dishwasher Safe. ✅ want to customize coffee flavor. Hryser’s pour over coffee maker enables you to make a cup of coffee that will be perfect for YOU. We recommend starting off by adding 2 tablespoons of ground coffee per 6 oz. of water, then experiment with the strength, sweeteners and cream. Take the coffee dripper with you when traveling and enjoy your coffee everywhere. All you need to do to brew the best coffee is to click the \"Add To Cart\" button at the top right of this page, and you will have your coffee dripper in a few days!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719cKOdF6eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HRYSER","source_asin":"B01FIG0OXS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-144117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FIG0OXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FIG0OXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
