window.products.push({"id":144213,"name":"Amana Washer Installation (Includes Parts and Haul Away) by J.B. Hunt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gtWj-EsyL._AC_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer Washer Installation (top loading and front loading models) Let qualified J.B. Hunt ® Final Mile Services install your new Amana ® , Haier ® or Frigidaire washer. You'll enjoy the convenience and confidence of white glove professional installation while ensuring the protection of your floors and possessions. Installation services will be performed at the time of your appliance delivery and include a two-person delivery team and one-year workmanship warranty. Installation Includes the Following Services All necessary installation accessories provided. You buy nothing more. Attach washer feet and level Remove shipping restraints Attach and install pedestals Attach and plug in power cord Attach and install water line Attach and install drain hose Remove and dispose of packaging materials Uninstall old appliance Relocate old appliance on same floor within home ( click here for relocation to a different floor), or haul away and dispose of old appliance 1 year warranty for workmanship Does not include stack kits for washer/dryer installations Cannot modify cabinets, counter tops or flooring to complete installation Cannot modify cabinets, counter tops or flooring to remove an existing appliance Cannot use installation accessories provided by the customer Cannot connect water lines to saddle valves Company Employees Trained for quality and consistency. Qualified Installers Respecting your property. Delivering superior results. Safe and Professional Drug tested and background checked. Arm badges with photo ID. How It Works Purchase installation fromJ.B. Hunt Final Mile Services J.B. Hunt Final Mile Services calls The delivery team contacts you within 30 minutes of arrival Qualified installers arrive with your appliance and required accessories How Scheduling Works J.B. Hunt Final Mile Services will schedule a time and date that satisfies your needs. Got a question or change of plans? Call our Customer Service Center at 1-800-723-4957 Monday through Fridaybetween 7:00 AM and Midnight CST. Schedule delivery Within 2 business days of receiving your order, J.B. Hunt will contact you to collect additional information, schedule a delivery date and set a four-hour delivery window that works for you. Appointment confirmation You'll receive a courtesy call the evening before delivery to remind you of your appointment. Pre-arrival call J.B. Hunt will call approximately 30 minutes before arrival at your home so you know your installation specialist on the way!  Please note that J.B. Hunt may utilize third parties for deliveries and installations in some remote areas. No Accessories Needed All required installation accessories are provided. No Worries. Comprehensive Coverage Delivery and installation available in all 48 contiguous states. Superior Service Call our Customer Service Center 1-800-723-4957 About J.B. Hunt Final Mile Services J.B. Hunt Final Mile Services is operated by J.B. Hunt Dedicated Contract Services ® (DCS). J.B. Hunt DCS specializes in the design, development, and execution of supply chain solutions that support virtually any transportation network with guaranteed capacity, industry-leading service, optimum efficiency and cost-savings management. DCS operates one of the largest nationwide, final mile cross dock networks with 80-plus locations totaling more than a million square feet of space. With services ranging from drop-off to appointment-generated white glove deliveries and safe, reliable transportation, we create new levels of value for our customers while acting as extensions of their enterprises. A coast-to-coast network of equipment and cross docks supplies the resources to tackle the biggest transportation and logistics challenges. Solutions are scaled to fit any customer need; whether it's two trucks or two hundred. From straight trucks to flatbeds to temperature-controlled, J.B. Hunt's equipment and expertise are unmatched within the transportation industry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gtWj-EsyL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J.B. Hunt Final Mile Services","source_asin":"B0054LCPGC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-144213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0054LCPGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0054LCPGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
