window.products.push({"id":144284,"name":"QP2-4.7/ QP2-4R7 4.7Ohm Refrigerator 3 Pin PTC Start/Starter Relay w/Refrigerator Overload Protector Replacement Parts Compatible with Whirlpool, Viss","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.35,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512dZspnaUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Package Included】You will get 1x 4.7 Ohm 3-pin PTC start relay and 1x 1/6HP Refrigerator overload protector, totally 2 pieces for you, convenient to replace the old or broken part of your refrigerator.【Note】Please carefully compare the pictures we provide with your old parts. Please check if your old relay is 3-pin. To make sure it fits your refrigerator. please consider before buying. 【Compatible models】PTC starter relay can suitable for most brands in the market that uses 3 Pins QP02-4.7 ohm resistor relay. The refrigerator overload protector can prevent the compressor in your refrigerator from overheating. Nice to replace part numbers QP2-4R7, QP2-4.7, QP2-4.7G12, WS-EP14F, 3990100070, 6R8MD3, AP4565041, 1206682, etc.You can find the compatible models in the product description. 【Save Time & Money】Prepared for some common problems, such as compressor is not starting, burning hot and \"click-clack\" about every 3-5 minutes when powered on. Very easy to install and inexpensive way to replace or repair your refrigerator / freezer / air-conditioning compressor, save a lot of money from buying a new refrigerator. 【Premium Quality】The refrigerator starter relays and overload protector are made of high-quality plastic + brass materials, Better than most tinned materials, responsive, durable, high reliability and has a long service life. Ideal replacement parts for refrigerator to replace old one. Pin Number: 3Pin. Relay overall size: 1.1'' x 0.83'' x 1.18''(L*W*H). Resistance: 4.7 ohm. Refrigerator Overheat Protector power: 1/6HP (125W), overall size: 1.26\" X 0.87\" X 1.18\"(L*W*H). 【Widely Applicable】The Overload Protector/ PTC Start Relay is suitable for the repair and assembly of various brands of refrigerator/freezer/air conditioner compressors. Such as the most mini fridges, car refrigerator, portable freezer, beverage & wine coolers, deep freezers, beer fridge. Compatible with many brands: Vissani, Koldfront, Danby, EdgeStar, Summit, Whirlpool, Frgidaire, LG, Kenmore, Haier, Igloo, Magic Chef, Insignia mini fridge, RV Freezer, Black and Decker small fridge, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512dZspnaUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XFYBZN","source_asin":"B0B7GDZBGX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-144284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7GDZBGX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7GDZBGX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":144285,"name":"Chest Freezer WANAI 5.0 Cubic Small Deep Freezer with Top Open Door and Removable Storage Basket, 7 Gears Temperature Control, Energy Saving, for Offi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uSGL0mYrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🐋【Compact Size & Large Capacity】: All functions are designed in such a compact size (‎26.9 x 18.8 x 30.3 In). The large capacity (5.0 cu ft) will not occupy too much space while ensuring that you can store enough food. It is very suitable for small apartments, offices and other small spaces. 🌐【Adjustable Control】: Adjustable 7-grade temperature control to select your desired temperature.“1” being the warmest and “7” being the coldest. Level 1-2 can be controlled from 32℉ to 50℉. Level 3-7 can be controlled from 32℉ to -11.2℉. ♻【Eco-friendly & Whisper-quiet】Using R600a high efficiency and low energy consumption compressor, this freezer cool quickly. Only 0.56 kilowatt-hour power needed per day. In addition, whisper-quiet consumption compressor will promise you and your families a sweet dream. 🍨【User-friendly Design】The door hinges of our deep freezer chest are between 45° and 90° angles. It provides convenience for storing food. The removable storage basket can keep & slide & move small items easily. You could see the items underneath the meat freezer quickly. Upright freezer with adjustable leveling legs to balance the unit on an uneven surface. 🧊【PACKAGE CONTENT & WARRANTY】: 1×deep freezer, 1x basket, 1×user’s manual, 1 Year seller Warranty and 7*24h customer service provided. You'd better put the mini freezer upright for at least 24 hours before using it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uSGL0mYrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WANAI","source_asin":"B09VC3V4NV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-144285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VC3V4NV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VC3V4NV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
