window.products.push({"id":144504,"name":"everydrop by Whirlpool Ice and Water Refrigerator Filter 2, EDR2RXD1, Single-Pack & Affresh Washing Machine Cleaner, Cleans Front Load and Top Load Wa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vmwNsM+rL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"EveryDrop by Whirlpool Refrigerator Water Filter 2, EDR2RXD1 (Pack of 1)Enjoy fresh, filtered water and ice from your refrigerator. Filter 2 from EveryDrop by Whirlpool Water Ice and Water is certified by NSF to reduce 24 contaminants - including pharmaceuticals, pesticides, waterborne parasites, lead, asbestos, and industrial chemicals in addition to providing great tasting water by reducing the presence of chlorine. Each filter provides 200 Gal. of filtered water and should be changed every 6 months to ensure proper contaminant removal and flow rate. EveryDrop by Whirlpool Water Ice and Water filters are the only filters guaranteed to work in Whirlpool, Maytag, KitchenAid, Jenn-Air, and Amana refrigerators.Affresh W10501250 Washing Machine Cleaner, 6 Tablets: Cleans Front Load and Top Load Washers, Including HEAffresh Washer Cleaner removes and prevents odor-causing residue that can occur in all washers. While bleach only kills odor-causing bacteria leaving behind the detergent residue, Affresh Washer Cleaner uses surfactant chemistry to remove the root problem. Affresh cleaner is a formulated, slow-dissolve, foaming tablet that gets under residue, breaks it up, and washes it away leaving the washer smelling fresh and clean. Simply place one tablet in the wash basket (without clothes) and run a Normal Cycle (hot option) or Clean Washer Cycle. Affresh brand is safe on septic tanks, and safe for all washer components. Use once a month to keep your machine fresher and cleaner. Package includes six tablets.Please note that date on the package is production date and NOT EXPIRATION Date.Affresh Washer Cleaner removes and prevents odor-causing residue that can occur in all washers. While bleach only kills odor-causing bacteria leaving behind the detergent residue, Affresh Washer Cleaner uses surfactant chemistry to remove the root problem. Affresh cleaner is a formulated, slow-dissolve, foaming tablet that gets under residue, breaks it up and washes it away leaving the washer smelling fresh and clean. Simply place one tablet in the wash basket (without clothes) and run a Normal Cycle (hot option) or Clean Washer Cycle. Affresh brand is safe on septic tanks and safe for all washer components. Use once a month to keep your machine fresher and cleaner. Package includes six tablets.Please note that date on the package is production date and NOT EXPIRATION Date.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vmwNsM+rL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EveryDrop by Whirlpool","source_asin":"B08F7YH96T","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-144504","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F7YH96T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F7YH96T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":144505,"name":"Beaquicy WB03K10303 Surface Burner Knob Replacement for GE Range - Replaces 1810427 AP4980246 EAP3486484 PS3486484","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P90gUgKVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝙒𝙃𝘼𝙏 𝘿𝙊 𝙔𝙊𝙐 𝙒𝘼𝙉𝙏 𝙏𝙊 𝙆𝙉𝙊𝙒】--- The WB03K10303 Range Surface Burner Knob is made of stainless steel, stain resistant, excellent durability and extended life, and it goes well with your chrome stove. The knob is 2.3 inches /5.6 cm in diameter and 1.3 inches /3.3 cm in height. The D-shaped at the bottom of the knob has plastic reinforcement with metal inserts for more durability to prevent stripping. The D-shaped is 0.23 inch /0.6 cm long and 0.18 inch /0.46 cm wide. 【𝙁𝙐𝙉𝘾𝙏𝙄𝙊𝙉&𝙃𝙄𝙂𝙃𝙇𝙄𝙂𝙃𝙏𝙎】--- The package includes 5 x WB03K10303 knobs for ge stove. The surface of WB03K10303 Range Surface Burner Knob is stainless steel, and the back is made of durable plastic structure, which has balanced characteristics. It allows you to control the temperature of the burner and this knob shaft has a piece of iron in it that extends the life of the knob and strengthens the knob. The part can fix the following symptoms:①Will not start②Will not select setting③Will not turn. 【𝙒𝙄𝘿𝙀 𝘾𝙊𝙈𝙋𝘼𝙏𝙄𝘽𝙇𝙀】--- WB03K10303 Surface Burner Control Knob Stove can fit for GE Range. ► Replaces Part Numbers: 1810427, AP4980246, EAP3486484, PS3486484, WB03K10208, PGB908SEM1SS, PGB910SEM1SS, PGB910SEM2SS, PGB910SEM3SS, PGB910SEM4SS, PGB908SEM2SS, J2B918SEL1SS, J2B918SEL2SS, P2B912SEM1SS, P2B912SEM2SS, P2B912SEM3SS, P2B918SEM1SS, P2B918SEM2SS, P2B918SEM3SS, P2B918SEM4SS, PGB916SEM1SS, PGB900SEM1SS, PGB900SEM2SS, PGB900SEM3SS, PGB900SEM4SS, PGB900SEM5SS, PGB908SEM3SS, PGB908SEM4SS, etc. 【𝘼𝙁𝙏𝙀𝙍-𝙎𝘼𝙇𝙀𝙎 𝙂𝙐𝘼𝙍𝘼𝙉𝙏𝙀𝙀】--- The WB03K10303 Knobs for GE Stove supports 365 days return and exchange.Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping,If you have any quality problem during warranty period,please contact customer service in time.We will try our best to solve the problem.Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. 【𝘿𝙄𝙔 𝙄𝙉𝙎𝙏𝘼𝙇𝙇𝘼𝙏𝙄𝙊𝙉】--- WB03K10303 Chrome Cooktop Control Knob is easy to install and does not require any professional tools. First, removed by pulling the old knob directly upwards. When installing, make sure that the \"OFF\" position of the knob is centered on the top. Slide the knob directly off the stem, and then slide the replacement knob back to the stem. Doing it yourself is very fulfilling and saves money on hiring a repairman and waiting time for repairs. It's a great deal!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61P90gUgKVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B086SKZZB2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-144505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086SKZZB2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B086SKZZB2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
