window.products.push({"id":144584,"name":"Compatible Oven Flat Igniter 316489403 for Frigidaire Electrolux Franklin Gibson White-Westinghouse Westinghouse Tappan Kelvinator Sears Kenmore","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CQ0uhvnYL._AC_.jpg","description":"The oven igniter, also called a glow bar, heats up the bimetal switch and causes the oven to ignite the fed to the burners. A common issue when the oven fails to ignite is a faulty glow bar. If the oven does not start within 90 seconds, the glow bar is likely the issue. Do not be fooled if the glow bar turns red. If it does not reach the appropriate temperature, the oven will not light. If your ignitor uses a connector on the end, reuse the connector from the old ignitor. Use your wire cutters to cut the wires on the old ignitor several inches above the connector. Strip the ends of the wires with a wire stripper. Place the end of a wire on the connector next to the end of a wire on your new ignitor. Use a ceramic wire nut to twist and hold the wires together. Your wires are not color coded, so it does not matter which wires are connected together. Your old ignitor can get very hot even if it doesn't ignite the burner tube. Please note: This is a generic product and not an OEM product and is not covered under any OEM manufacturer's warranty. The OEM brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the OEM brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CQ0uhvnYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomePartsStore","source_asin":"B07TJ58KH6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-144584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TJ58KH6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TJ58KH6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
