window.products.push({"id":144648,"name":"Capsulier LITE Coffee Brewer with Reusable Capsi Caspule + Cleaning Cloth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31VWWTBRhQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Build Your Own Artisanal Nespresso Pods! The World's First Single-push, Reusable, Mess-free Capsule Maker. Craft a coffee capsule that’s easy on the environment and your budget. Create your own capsule with exotic beans and handpicked spices. Load the roasted and ground beans into the Capsulier, close the lid, and push the lever, you’ll have a capsule ready for use in seconds. The Capsulier LITE gives you a capsule that’s reusable, which means you can create your own custom blends in pods that are eco-friendly, easy to clean and economical. The Design: Convenient, Quick, and Easy to Use Designed in Sweden. My goal was to create an object that was aesthetically pleasing, but also versatile and functional, with a discreet beauty that should feel right at home on any counter. A Companion to your capsule machine Our design embodies a clean, minimalist aesthetic. The Capsulier is a companion piece to your coffee machine, compact and understated, designed to sit comfortably alongside most coffee machines and gadgets. With the Included Capsi Capsule you will be able to easily make your favorite Espresso, Cappucino, Latte or Americana and will never be limited to a brands single use coffee blends, enjoy your favorite coffee with the Nespresso Machine you Love!Compatibe with Most Nespresso Machinesbr>Paired with a capsule machine, enjoy a better quality cup without much more effort. Sure, it takes a bit more in terms of upfront investment, but any good barista will tell you of the importance of a great set of tools. Once you’re set up, each capsule comes in at little over 10 cents, that’s 7x savings compared to a lifetime of branded capsules, and a nearly infinite variety of ingredients to play with.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31VWWTBRhQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Capsulier","source_asin":"B07XL4M4G9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-144648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XL4M4G9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XL4M4G9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
