window.products.push({"id":144836,"name":"Beaquicy WB44T10011 Oven Bake Element - Replacement for Ken-more G-E Oven, Replaces: WB44T10059, 820921, AH249286, EA249286, PS249286, B003BIGDEA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JjC7tVmdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【𝙒𝘽𝟰𝟰𝙏𝟭𝟬𝟬𝟭𝟭 𝙊𝙑𝙀𝙉 𝙃𝙀𝘼𝙏𝙄𝙉𝙂 𝙀𝙇𝙀𝙈𝙀𝙉𝙏】Bake element WB44T10011 is at the bottom of the oven and supplies the heat for baking. WB44T10011 Bake Element turns on an off through out the time that the oven is on to ensure consistent heat at the temperature that was set. ►The Rated Power is 3410W and The Voltage is 220V. The Bake Element has 3 mounting legs. Terminals are male spade.►DIMENSION: Mounting bracket has 2 holes on either end for mounting to back of range 2-7/8\" centers. The Length from Mounting Bracket to end of Element is about 16-1/2\". The length (bent at 30 degree angle) from Bracket to terminal end is about 2-1/2\". ✅【 𝙈𝘼𝘿𝙀 𝙊𝙁 𝙉𝙄𝘾𝙆𝙀𝙇 𝙎𝙏𝘼𝙄𝙉𝙇𝙀𝙎𝙎 𝙎𝙏𝙀𝙇𝙇 𝘼𝙇𝙇𝙊𝙔】Includes 1 x WB44T10011 Range Oven Bake Element. The oven heating element replacement wb44t10011 oven range stove bake element is made of high temperature resistant NICKEL STAINLESS STELL ALLOY, this material can be used for a long time. Cooled element is easy to clean using only a soft sponge or cloth and warm water with mild soap solution, then wipe dry. If your oven isn't heating up properly or taking longer than usual to reach the desired temperature, the wb44t10011 heating element likely requires a replacement ✅【𝙎𝙐𝙄𝙏𝘼𝘽𝙇𝙀 𝙁𝙊𝙍 𝙈𝙊𝙎𝙏 𝘽𝙍𝘼𝙉𝘿𝙎 𝙍𝘼𝙉𝙂𝙀𝙎】Beaquicy WB44T10011 Bake Element fits for GE, Kenmore Range. ►WB44T10011 ge kenmore oven bake element Replaces jbp68dm1bb, jbp68dm1cc, jbp68dm1ww, jbp68dm2bb, jbp68dm2cc, jbp68dm2ww, jbp68dxm1ww, jbp68dxm2ww, jbp72dm1bb, ecbp70sk1ss, ecbp70sk2ss, ecbp70sk3ss, ecbp70sk4ss, ecbp70wk1ww, ecbp70wk2ww, ecbp70wk3ww, ecbp70wk4ww, ecbp82bj1bb, ecbp82bj2bb, ecbp82bj3bb, ecbp82sj1ss, ecbp82sj2ss, ecbp82sj3ss, ecbp82sk1ss, ecbp82sk2ss, ecbp82wj1ww ecbp82wj2ww, ecbp82wj3ww, ecbp82wk1ww, ecbp82wk2ww, ecbp85wj1ww, ecbp85wj2ww, jbp70dm1ww, jbp70dm2bb, jbp70dm2ww, etc. ✅【𝟯𝟲𝟱 𝘿𝘼𝙔𝙎 𝙒𝘼𝙍𝙍𝘼𝙉𝙏𝙔】--- The WB44T10011 Oven Range Stove Bake Oven Element Replacement supports 365 days RETURN and EXCHANGE. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. ►The Wb44t10011 heating element can Fix The Following Symptoms:①There is little to no heat when baking②The element will not heat ③Uneven heat when baking④Element will not turn on⑤The element is worn or corroded⑥The oven is tripping the circuit breaker or blowing a fuse⑦There are sparks or smoke coming from the element. ✅【𝘽𝙍𝙄𝙉𝙂 𝘾𝙊𝙉𝙑𝙀𝙉𝙄𝙀𝙉𝘾𝙀 𝙁𝙊𝙍 𝙔𝙊𝙐𝙍 𝙇𝙄𝙁𝙀】 --- Unplug your oven or turn off the circuit breaker before installing WB44T10011 ge oven bake element. Prepare a pair of work gloves, needle-nosed pliers and a phillips screwdriver. Remove the oven door, remove the screws from the lower heating element, remove the wires from the heating element, remove the lower element to secure the new one, and then reassemble the oven in reverse. It doesn't take too long, and you can follow the Youtube videos if you have trouble installing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JjC7tVmdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B09VK9RMGJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-144836","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VK9RMGJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VK9RMGJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
