window.products.push({"id":144854,"name":"KUPPET Portable Ice Maker Machine for Countertop Self-Cleaning Electric Ice Maker with Scoop and Basket, 9 Ice Cubes Ready in 6 mins, 26 lbs Ice in 24","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dvh8ZgWJL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊【PORTABLE & SUPER QUIET】KUPPET ice maker has a small body with perfect size, suitable to be placed on any countertop. It is ideal to use indoors or outdoors for family gatherings, party carnival, leisure time or office needs, you can enjoy happiness anytime and anywhere. It has powerful but quiet compressor, and your party won't be disturbed by any noise. 🍨【INTELLIGENT & CONVENIENT】 User friendly control panel with easy-touch buttons. The transparent window makes the ice making situation clear at a glance, it stops working when the ice is full. Detachable ice bucket makes you take the prepared ice anywhere at any time. One touch self-cleaning, save your cleaning trouble. 🍧【EFFICIENT WORK】 High speed ice making makes a fresh life! 9 ice cubes ready in 6 mins, 26 lbs/ 12 kg of ice in 24 hrs. Equipped with a 1.5 L / 68 oz water storage tank. Note: For normal use, please must let machine stand upright for 4 hours before first use. 🍦【SAFETY & ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION】 Food grade materials makes reassuring to eat. Thickening foam layer with large density, uniform and effective isolation of external heat for good cold insulation effect. When ice melts, water will flow back to the reservoir for water conservation. Low energy consumption machine, save water and electricity costs any time. ❄️【ICE DESCRIPTION】 Small or large ice for various needs. Round ice for oral protection, hollow ice floating in the glass to decorate you drink.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Dvh8ZgWJL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUPPET","source_asin":"B08HRSJK6W","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-144854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HRSJK6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HRSJK6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
